# GET_CONFIGURATION of register 0020h, and its ACCEPT response.
#
# Transcribed byte for byte from tests/vectors/espi_dump.txt, lines 16-29 --
# a third-party decoder's export of real hardware. Nothing here is computed.
#
# The address goes out MSB first (00 then 20 = 0020h) while the DWord comes
# back LSB first (00 0B 00 00 = 00000B00h). Section 5.1, p.86.
CMD 21 00 20 C8
TAR
RSP 08 00 0B 00 00 0F 01 91
